{"node_id": "real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424_12_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0006"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0006_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "They may also order bloodwork or brain imaging to identify\nfor any underlying causes.", "semantic_text": "They may also order bloodwork or brain imaging to identify for any underlying causes.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0006_geometry", "bbox": [74, 288, 526, 340], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0006"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_16/hybrid/real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424/page_0012/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424_12_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0008"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0008_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Most tremors can't be cured, but they can be managed. Treatment\ndepends on the type of tremor and its severity. If tremor is caused\nby a different health condition, treating that condition can reduce\nor stop the tremor. Mild cases may not need treatment, especially\nif you aren't bothered by the symptoms.", "semantic_text": "Most tremors can't be cured, but they can be managed. Treatment depends on the type of tremor and its severity. If tremor is caused by a different health condition, treating that condition can reduce or stop the tremor. Mild cases may not need treatment, especially if you aren't bothered by the symptoms.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0008_geometry", "bbox": [74, 385, 572, 514], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0008"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_16/hybrid/real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424/page_0012/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424_12_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0009"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0009_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "■ Medication. Certain medications can help slow or suppress\nsymptoms. Botulinum toxin injections can also help certain\nkinds of tremor.\n■ Surgery. For severe cases of tremor and when medicines\naren't helping, a doctor may recommend surgical treatment\nsuch as deep brain stimulation.\n■ Therapy. Physical, speech, and occupational therapy can all\nhelp control symptoms of tremor and manage daily tasks.\n■ Assistive devices. Certain assistive tools and technologies\ncan help simplify daily tasks such as eating, writing, or\nusing a computer. Some wearable devices can also help\nsuppress tremor.", "semantic_text": "■ Medication. Certain medications can help slow or suppress symptoms. Botulinum toxin injections can also help certain kinds of tremor. ■ Surgery. For severe cases of tremor and when medicines aren't helping, a doctor may recommend surgical treatment such as deep brain stimulation. ■ Therapy. Physical, speech, and occupational therapy can all help control symptoms of tremor and manage daily tasks. ■ Assistive devices. Certain assistive tools and technologies can help simplify daily tasks such as eating, writing, or using a computer. Some wearable devices can also help suppress tremor.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [85, 517, 573, 816], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_16/hybrid/real_054_batch_49_2024-Issue8.508C_.090424/page_0012/decisions.json"}
